@startuml SEQ_21_MELIHAT_REKAP_PENILAIAN
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-21: Melihat Rekap Hasil Penilaian

actor       "Admin / Asisten / Dosen / Kadep"  as Actor
boundary    "Browser"                          as Browser
control     "PraktikumController"              as Controller
entity      "Praktikum Model"                  as ModelP
entity      "Penilaian Model"                  as ModelN

== Melihat Rekap Nilai ==

Actor   ->  Browser    : Buka menu Rekap Praktikum, pilih praktikum

Browser ->  Controller : GET /praktikum/{id}/rekap-nilai

Controller -> ModelP   : Query praktikum + pertemuan + tugas + praktikan
ModelP --> Controller  : Data praktikum
Controller -> ModelN   : Query semua nilai
ModelN --> Controller  : Data nilai
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman rekap nilai (view-only)
Browser --> Actor      : Tabel rekap nilai: Nama Praktikan, Nilai per Tugas, Nilai Akhir

@enduml